    /// Every runtime switch in TLD RevaMP, in one list: the debug bridge's `switches [text]` shows each with its value now;
    /// `set <path> <value>` changes one. Kinds: Test (a test script flips it), OptIn (off for players until tested, or a
    /// value to tune), Config (a player or host setting, also in the BepInEx config), Other. A switch whose experiment is
    /// finished is removed, its old behaviour with it (121 on 2026-11-12, 133 on 2026-11-18). tools/unit/SwitchesListTest checks that
    /// every path here names a static field in src/TLDRevamp, so the list can't go stale.
